'''885-1''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Anniversary/14th Year|14th Anniversary]]. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

{{Cat Info
